      "learning_outcomes": "After taking this course, students are expected to:\n• talk about daily situations related to shopping, ordering and paying in a restaurant, health issues.\n• use essential linguistic features of Russian such as plural forms of neuter and masculine nouns, accusative case for objects, instrumental case of nouns, the past tense and the future tense of verbs.",
